{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mandated Fate</strong>\u00a0is dark retro-futuristic story-driven game where you play as a weary inspector, a man out of place in a newly established authoritarian regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1985, a technological empire seized power, driven by an ultimate goal: discovering the anti-gravity particle to conquer space. Yet, one old district resists\u2014no one seems to know how. As an inspector, you are sent to investigate a strange murder in this outcast place. Through five narrative paths, your choices will shape your loyalty to those you deem worthy of your trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a highly detailed open world, where the striking contrast between modern authoritarian architecture and remnants of the past tells a story of its own. Find your path between your own values and the oppressive ideals of this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face truly critical choices from the very beginning\u2014decisions that will have a significant impact on the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly detailed open world with numerous explorable building interiors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and complex dialogues that shape interactions and outcomes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark and captivating atmosphere inspired by neo-noir and cyberpunk aesthetics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully functional subway system integrated into the game world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599830?t=1757801514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599830/fda30a553efc42649a34e7e3442859f5419c5f9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757801514","capsule_image":"https: