will have a significant impact on the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly detailed open world with numerous explorable building interiors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and complex dialogues that shape interactions and outcomes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark and captivating atmosphere inspired by neo-noir and cyberpunk aesthetics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully functional subway system integrated into the game world.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Thibaut Billerot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599830/d1b22c0d950dea0472e4c9a5e567ea4c4b940cd6/header.jpg?t=1757801514","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Tetrarchy Studios<br />\r\n941 542 458 R.C.S. Paris<br />\r\nSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 par Actions Simplifi\u00e9e<br />\r\nPr\u00e9sident : Thibaut Billerot<br />\r\n15 rue Claude Lorrain 75016 Paris","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156408,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156408/movie480.mp4?t=1757801509","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156408/movie_max.mp4?t=1757801509"},"name":"Mandated Fate - Pre-Alpha Trailer (September 2025)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156408/ec7509ab259048e56c5cec0ce2e3216c6dadc44e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757801509","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156408/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757801509","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156408/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757801509"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257156788,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156788/movie480.mp4?t=1757801512","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156788/movie_max.mp4?t=1757801512"},"name":"OUTDATED Mandated Fate - Developmen